---
title: "Load the capture module before dispatching its effect"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: finished
    lg1: in progress
    lg2: Breaks UnsupportedReturnsENOTSUP
    lg3: Path to the UnsupportedReturnsENOTSUP bug
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 blue
  class lg2 breaks
  class lg3 bugPath
  s0: Module loading
  s1: Capture handler registered
  s2: Window and unexpected error returned
  s3: Window and unsupported error returned
  s4: Native capture dispatched
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: initialize the module
  s1 --> s3: return ENOTSUP and window
  s1 --> s4: run native capture
  s1 --> s2: return an unexpected error
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 blue
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 blue
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 teal
  class s2 breaks
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 teal
  class s4 teal
